  dishName: Batangas Goto
  dishSprite: {fileID: 1222128613088977701, guid: 9273c5b62e589f049959263daebca091, type: 3}
  pages:
  - Great work! The bowl in front of you is a small act of care.
  - "Chinese congee technique, \r\nSpanish-era beef, "
  - 'Filipino garnishes, all brought together in a dish that families reach for when
    someone they love needs comfort. '
  - The ginger does more than flavour.
  - 'The ginger does more than flavour. It warms the body and settles the stomach, '
  - which is why goto has been a convalescent food for generations.
  - 'The next time you make a bowl for someone who is unwell, '
  - you are doing what Filipino families have been doing with this dish for nearly
    two centuries.
